# Vercel builds the STATIC frontend only.
#
# Everything below is the Python pipeline, which cannot run here: Vercel's
# zero-config detects api/main.py as a serverless function, installs
# requirements.txt, and CadQuery/OpenCascade takes the bundle to 1165 MB
# against a 500 MB function limit (measured, not estimated).
#
# The deployed build replays the frozen run in web/public/replay instead.
# For live generation, run the FastAPI backend as a container -- see
# DEPLOYMENT.md and the Dockerfile.

api/
spec2cad/
scripts/
eval/
tests/
examples/
requirements.txt
Dockerfile
pytest.ini
run_dev.ps1
*.py
__pycache__/
build/
